+NETWORKTEST3 STATIC AUDIT
+=========================
+Release: 0.9.4-arm-v22beta-networktest3-wall-watchdog
+Baseline: NetworkTest2 async-DNS full source
+Reference: DynarmicTest14 full source (network ABI/control-flow reference only)
+
+PRESERVATION RESULT
+-------------------
