+PASS: watchdog model quick-run case completed without false firing.
+PASS: watchdog model synthetic stuck-run case was preempted in approximately 4.2 ms.
+PASS: preservation hash comparison; only src/dynarmic_probe.cpp changed under src/.
+
+BINARY BUILD STATUS
+-------------------
+The source merge is complete, but a Windows executable was not produced in this Linux execution environment. The supplied source archives and preserved build cache contain compiled Dynarmic/import libraries but omit the required compiler executable and complete Windows/Dynarmic/Boost headers. External toolchain archive downloads were unavailable here. Packaging an older executable or binary-patching it would not preserve the NetworkTest2 fixes and was intentionally not done.
+
+Use BUILD_V22BETA_X64.cmd on Windows with the pinned prerequisites and game-v22beta-selected.apk to create dist-arm-wrapper-v22beta-networktest3-wall-watchdog.
